Phase: Numbers
Input: Numeric Token Split Unit Time
Options: control=appelt

Rule: measurement1
(
	{Numeric}
	({Unit}):unit
):match
-->
:match.Measurement = { rule = measurement1, quantity = :match.Numeric.value, units =:match.Unit.Value}


 //5-10mg 
Rule: measurement2Range
(
	({Numeric})
	({Token.string == "-"})
	({Numeric}):num
	({Unit}):unit
):match
-->
:match.Measurement = { rule = measurement2Range, quantity = :num.Numeric.value, units =:match.Unit.Value}